// Your input overrides. Defaults loaded from
// ~/.local/share/nirimaki/default/niri/input.kdl — re-declare the
// `input { … }` block here to replace it (input is keyed, not
// additive, so a partial override needs a full block).
//
// Wiki: https://niri-wm.github.io/niri/Configuration:-Input
//
// Example (German keyboard, caps as ctrl, disabled focus-follows-mouse):
//
//     input {
//         keyboard {
//             xkb {
//                 layout "de"
//                 options "ctrl:nocaps"
//             }
//             numlock
//         }
//         touchpad {
//             tap
//             natural-scroll
//         }
//         // focus-follows-mouse off (remove to disable)
//     }
